'''Starting Plains''' (Japanese: '''はじまりの平原''' ''Starting Plains'') is a {{TCGP|Stadium card}} in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Stadium
|rule=SV Stadium
|effect=Each Basic Pokémon in play ''(both yours and your opponent's)'' gets +20 HP.
}}

==Trivia==
*This card's effect is similar to that of the {{TCG|Lively Stadium}} card in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but increases HP by 20 instead of 30. 
